<title>USA: IBM Corp may issue 100-year bond debt.</title>
<headline>IBM Corp may issue 100-year bond debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBM Corp is expected to issue a 100-year debt offering via lead underwriter Salomon Brothers Inc, high-grade syndicate sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The size of the IBM deal is expected to total between $500 and $600 million, sources said.</p>
<p>Price talk on the issue is seen in the high 70 basis points over U.S. Treasuries arena, sources added.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
